=This is a request from tenant {{ $json.tenant_config.name }}, the type of event generating this request is {{ $json.event_type }}.

For this request, the following services are needed: {{ [$json.tenant_config.data_handling === 'pii_masked' ? 'PII Masker Service (run this first before anything else)' : '', $json.tenant_config.email.enabled ? 'Email Service' : '', $json.tenant_config.crm.enabled ? 'CRM Service' : ''].filter(s => s !== '').join(', ') }}.

If PII Masker Service is listed, call PII Masker Service first and pass its returned payload to all subsequent service tools.

Please use the below data to complete the request using the available tools.

Tenant config: {{ JSON.stringify($json.tenant_config) }}
Event type: {{ $json.event_type }}
Payload: {{ JSON.stringify($json.payload) }}

After calling all required tools, return only this JSON and nothing else:
{
  "tenant_id": "{{ $json.tenant_config.tenant_id }}",
  "event_type": "{{ $json.event_type }}",
  "services_called": [],
  "status": "completed"
}
Fill services_called with the names of the tools you called.

